            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MamaMia72"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I opted to make these without the icing since the others said they were really sweet and I also thought they would be good topped with vanilla ice cream. I have to say for as much butter and sugar as these have I would prefer something else. I just didn't find them all that exciting. \n\nI was a little disappointed that the carmel sauce wasn't all that carmelly tasting...it kind of just soaked into the cake part.",
